---
import ServicePage from '../components/ServicePage.astro';
---

<ServicePage
  title="Longevity & Performance"
  description="Longevity medicine and performance optimization in Florida. Biomarker testing, hormone optimization, peptide therapy, and proactive health strategies."
  eyebrow="longevity & performance"
  heroTitle="Optimize your health, not just your lifespan."
  heroSub="Feeling your best at 40, 50, and beyond requires more than avoiding disease. We use biomarker-driven protocols to help you perform, recover, and think at your highest level."
  chipLabel="proactive health"
  chipClass="chip-butter"
  heroSurface="rgba(194,122,99,0.10)"
  heroImage="/images/hero-longevity.png"
  heroVariant="fullwidth"
  heroFlip={true}
  stepsAsHero={true}
  values={[
    {
      icon: "▲",
      heading: "Biomarker-driven protocols",
      body: "We go beyond standard labs. Advanced panels reveal what's driving aging at the cellular level and where the biggest levers are for you."
    },
    {
      icon: "⬡",
      heading: "Hormone optimization",
      body: "Testosterone, DHEA, growth hormone pathways, thyroid. Optimizing hormonal health has profound effects on energy, body composition, and cognitive function."
    },
    {
      icon: "○",
      heading: "Peptide therapy",
      body: "Peptides like BPC-157, TB-500, and growth hormone secretagogues are emerging tools for recovery, muscle preservation, and metabolic health."
    }
  ]}
  features={[
    {
      heading: "The difference between surviving and thriving",
      body: "Standard medicine is designed to catch disease. Longevity medicine is designed to prevent it and optimize function in the years before disease appears. We look at inflammatory markers, metabolic flexibility, hormonal status, cardiovascular risk, and mitochondrial health. Then we build a protocol around what will move the needle most for you specifically.",
      chipLabel: "advanced biomarkers",
      chipClass: "chip-butter",
      imgAlt: "DNA molecule visualization",
      scene: "dna"
    },
    {
      heading: "Recovery, strength, and mental sharpness",
      body: "Whether you're an athlete looking for a performance edge, a professional who needs to perform cognitively for decades, or someone who just wants to stay strong and active into their 70s and 80s, the protocols we use are evidence-informed and individualized. Peptide therapy, hormone optimization, sleep quality, and cardiovascular conditioning all have a role.",
      chipLabel: "performance protocols",
      chipClass: "chip-terracotta",
      imgAlt: "Mature athlete training outdoors",
      image: "/images/feat-longevity-2.jpg",
      flip: true
    }
  ]}
  testimonials={[]}
  steps={[
    {
      heading: "Longevity intake and goals",
      body: "We start with your current health, what you want to optimize, and your timeline. Performance goals, cognitive health, longevity, body composition. All of it."
    },
    {
      heading: "Advanced biomarker panel",
      body: "Comprehensive labs beyond the standard annual physical: advanced lipids, inflammatory markers, hormones, metabolic panel, and more depending on your goals."
    },
    {
      heading: "Optimization protocol",
      body: "A personalized protocol built around your labs and goals. Follow-ups every 8-12 weeks to review results, adjust, and track progress over time."
    }
  ]}
  faq={[
    {
      q: "What is peptide therapy?",
      a: "Peptides are short chains of amino acids that signal specific biological processes. Peptides like BPC-157, TB-500, and growth hormone secretagogues (sermorelin, ipamorelin) are used for recovery, tissue repair, and metabolic optimization. We discuss what the evidence supports and what's appropriate for your situation."
    },
    {
      q: "How is this different from standard preventive care?",
      a: "Standard preventive care focuses on avoiding disease. Longevity medicine focuses on optimizing function, performance, and quality of life throughout the aging process. We order labs and use protocols that most primary care practices don't offer."
    },
    {
      q: "Is this only for athletes?",
      a: "Not at all. Most of our longevity patients are busy professionals, parents, and people in their 40s-60s who want to stay sharp, strong, and healthy. Athletic performance is one use case, but it is far from the only one."
    },
    {
      q: "How much does a longevity protocol cost?",
      a: "Costs vary based on labs ordered and treatments prescribed. We are transparent about pricing before you commit to anything. Many patients find the investment significant relative to the impact on quality of life."
    }
  ]}
/>
